{"data":{"body":"[P2] Reconsider the untested configuration branch under rule 4\n\nBoth new case-27 integration tests set `OTEL_INVOKE_TARGET_FUNCTION_NAME`, while the template tests only inspect handler source. Removing this error branch therefore leaves their assertions unchanged, violating CONTRIBUTING rule 4, \u201cEvery branch has a test that fails without it.\u201d The missing-target behavior has no regression protection. Return to the design phase under rule 8, step 6, and decide whether this separate validation path is necessary and how its behavior will be established.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABBSAU6A","finding_digest":"95cb071661f912e763bef0dbb31a0eb9972e42a11a83b4f4e67d91d25af48592","finding_id":"arf_v1_sxfqoftb7ejooy566dn3ggqoxg","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-conformance-tests-otel/handlers/otel_27_chained_invoke_suspend.ts::requiredtargetfunction::untested-missing-target-branch","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-conformance-tests-otel/handlers/otel_27_chained_invoke_suspend.ts::requiredtargetfunction::untested-missing-target-branch","line":35,"observation_digest":"2935c10ec7ba754b541ab979d99501f2560bc1291592068024a7534e01ee6362","observation_id":"aro_v1_fe24cdwhxj2uwva2xf45tfib6j","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-conformance-tests-otel/handlers/otel_27_chained_invoke_suspend.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-26T18:26:16Z","review_id":"arr_v1_phn6nygs4eqsnr7kkzxq7qsc5i","reviewed_base_sha":"9942bdfc82cac4b54e392e2b3475539bb0d9ae59","reviewed_head_sha":"98216cdbc18a1358e62eab48e1f36efc046c90cb","reviewer":"codex","start_line":33,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1068},"record_id":"art_v1_vt5syfofyqmdlx5lyfrhjrwilf","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-26T18:26:16Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
